{"id":"169935","t":{"th":"แทงก์สุดแกร่ง แห่งวงกต","ro":"Saikyou Tank no Meikyuu Kouryaku: Tairyoku 9999 no Rare Skill-mochi Tank, Yuusha Party wo Tsuihou Sareru","en":"The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids -A Tank with a Rare 9999 Resistance Skill Got Kicked from the Hero's Party-","na":"最強タンクの迷宮攻略　～体力9999のレアスキル持ちタンク、勇者パーティーを追放される～"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx169935-w808lLrdFXcl.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx169935-w808lLrdFXcl.jpg","color":"#f1c90d","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/169935-lbNLkp8Ou8OG.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":23,"season":"WINTER","year":2024,"start":"2024-01-07","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"score":59,"pop":38290,"studio":"STUDIO POLON","desc":"Rud, a shielder with a defense stat of 9999, the highest ever known, serves as a tank for the Hero's Party as they carry out raids in labyrinths. His goal is to find a treasure hidden in one of the labyrinths that can grant any wish, and use it to cure his beloved younger sister's illness... but the tyrannical hero suddenly kicks him out of the party, saying his skill is \"useless.\" So Rud makes his way back to his hometown. Along the way, he saves a young girl, and she reveals the true nature of his skill... which turns out to be incredibly powerful! This is the story of the adventures of Rud, a tank with both the highest defense stat in history and an unparalleled skill!","descTh":"Rud ผู้พิทักษ์ที่มีสถานะการป้องกัน 9999 ซึ่งสูงที่สุดเท่าที่เคยรู้จัก ทำหน้าที่เป็นแทงค์ให้กับ Hero's Party ในขณะที่พวกเขาบุกโจมตีในเขาวงกต เป้าหมายของเขาคือการหาสมบัติที่ซ่อนอยู่ในเขาวงกตที่สามารถขอพรได้ และใช้มันเพื่อรักษาอาการป่วยของน้องสาวที่รักของเขา... แต่จู่ๆ ฮีโร่ผู้กดขี่ก็เตะเขาออกจากปาร์ตี้โดยบอกว่าทักษะของเขา \"ไร้ประโยชน์\" รุดจึงเดินทางกลับบ้านเกิด ระหว่างทาง เขาช่วยเด็กสาวคนหนึ่ง และเธอก็เผยธรรมชาติที่แท้จริงของทักษะของเขา...ซึ่งกลายเป็นว่าทรงพลังอย่างไม่น่าเชื่อ! นี่คือเรื่องราวของการผจญภัยของ Rud รถถังที่มีทั้งสถิติการป้องกันสูงสุดในประวัติศาสตร์และทักษะที่ไม่มีใครเทียบได้!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"XPLVbhfZAg4","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/169935","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/56845","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"anione_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_YV8EWtbQXE5ae2wQ6Gp2-1Pd0EsQ2kK","lang":"sub","eps":[["7","y:VSW8cRMEJi4",1730279190,"~",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[31.5,120.0],[1314.5,1404.2]]}],["8","y:T_aMRWE9Dxc",1730279190,"~",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[184.5,273.0],[1314.5,1404.2]]}],["9","y:U35Td7DhlWQ",1730279190,"~",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[64.5,153.0],[1314.5,1404.2]]}],["10","y:j0-sOR0TGT4",1730279190,"~",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[95.5,184.0],[1314.5,1404.2]]}],["11","y:FOR2s6D-aL0",1730279190,"~",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[110.5,199.0],[1314.5,1404.2]]}],["12","y:EKgf6h8PXuo",1730279190,"~",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[0.5,89.0],[1313.4,1404.2]],"fin":1}],["6","y:FE4aNyURJk0",1707586208,"x",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[230.5,319.0],[1314.5,1404.2]]}],["5","y:2qLugPRr4es",1706981400,"x",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[200.5,289.0],[1299.6,1404.2]]}],["4","y:wjvVSPw1QMk",1706376608,"x",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[142.5,231.0]]}],["3","y:e7rsNvTOJpY",1705771808,"x",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[113.5,202.0],[1232.5,1320.0]]}],["2","y:QafdJZJcUSw",1705167008,"x",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[107.5,196.6],[1314.4,1404.2]]}],["1","y:7qjG03eJcgU",1704562209,"x",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[45.5,134.6],[1314.5,1404.2]]}]],"pat":"ทุกวันพุธ–ศุกร์ 18:00 น."},{"p":"anione_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_YV8EWtbQXEX20uR_qdpGbv84MSxPVhA","lang":"dub","eps":[["7","y:oDVWAfz2uUw",1730277121,"~",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[31.5,120.0],[1314.5,1404.2]]}],["8","y:6snsd52SqHk",1730277121,"~",null,null,{"d":1414,"sk":[[184.5,273.0],[1314.5,1404.2]]}],["9","y:saS6n4IRiUE",1730277121,"~",null,null,{"d":1